+    - upstream: exp6811-operational-obligation-automaton-v3
+      artifact_field: operational_automaton_fixture_ready
+      op: '=='
+      value: true
+  prompt: |
+    CONTEXT:
+    Exp6776 blocked before accrual because both GPUs had unrelated owners. Exp6811 supplies the
+    owned operational-obligation interface. AdaMEM motivates transient stepwise strategy state.
+    Compare static episode-start guidance with stepwise read-only retrieval in shadow mode, then
+    collect only the bounded active top-up needed for complete next-action outcomes.
+
+    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
+
+    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
+    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
+    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6776_arc_shadow_supervisor_accrual.json
+    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6811_operational_obligation_automaton_v3.json
+    - {project_root}/python/carnot/agentic/arc_trajectory_supervisor.py
+    - {project_root}/python/carnot/agentic/e3_agent_policy.py
+    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/agentic-harness/spec.md
+    - {project_root}/ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml
+
+    TASK:
+    Reuse compatible durable external-evaluation rows first. Run only the bounded top-up needed
+    for the frozen evidence floor. Compare episode-start static guidance with stepwise read-only
+    strategy retrieval. Use the production policy and no per-game adapter. Strategy may advise or
+    rank. It may not authorize an action or persist state during an active episode.
+
+    CONCRETE STEPS:
+    0. PRECONDITIONS: require operational_automaton_fixture_ready=true, the production
+       make_carnot_agent and E3AgentPolicy path, registry precheck, source prohibition, adapter-off
+       state, the exact Qwen3.6 GGUF hash, and one task-owned GPU lease. Define MODEL_SPECS exactly
+       as unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF. On bounded lease or model failure write complete_blocked_
+       arc_stepwise_strategy_accrual with gate_check_summary and stop. Do not kill or reuse an
+       external process.
+    1. Write tests first for immutable strategy snapshots, episode-start and stepwise retrieval,
+       shadow action identity, exact authority, source denial, adapter denial, process isolation,
+       active-episode write rejection, checkpoint restart, and row completeness.
+    2. Freeze the compatible durable-row filter, evidence floor, game cells, seeds, budgets,
+       censoring, action limits, prompts, chat template, and strategy bytes before top-up.
+    3. In shadow cells, preserve the production action and record its hash for both guidance modes.
+       In active cells, record the exact next-action outcome. Do not infer utility from strategy
+       text or from a same-model vote.
+    4. Run fresh task-owned processes. Record lease ownership, PID, model hash, CUDA offload,
+       tokens, actions, strategy reads, exact obligation receipts, atomic checkpoints, and teardown.
+    5. Emit one row per game-seed-guidance-mode-attempt. Set stepwise_strategy_accrual_ready from
+       complete eligible rows, immutable snapshots, exact receipts, process isolation, and clean
+       teardown, independent of effect sign. This field is consumed by Exp6820 and Exp6822.
+    6. Run focused tests, ruff, OpenSpec coverage, applicable ARC E2E checks, adversarial
+       verification, artifact convention audit, and verdict-row consistency lint.
+    7. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS AND PRINCIPLES: field_principles (principle per field);
+       inference_substrate (production local llama.cpp CUDA agent path); duration_s (measured wall
+       time); random_seed (frozen game and attempt seeds); reproducibility_checksum (bind inputs,
+       rows, commands, and output); MODEL_SPECS (exact Qwen3.6 flagship hub ID); model_specs (path,
+       hash, revision, quantization, chat template, and limits); source_artifact_hashes (owned
+       obligation and durable evidence); registry_precheck (no complete level is re-solved);
+       frozen_manifest (games, arms, budgets, and censoring); immutable_strategy_hashes (read-only
+       state); process_isolation_receipts (fresh task-owned cells); gpu_receipts (lease and CUDA
+       ownership); rows (every game-seed-mode-attempt); shadow_action_identity (no shadow influence);
+       exact_next_action_outcomes (active utility authority); active_episode_write_count (must be
+       zero); adapter_use_count (must be zero); source_access_count (must be zero); solve_claim
+       (false); solve_provenance (live_agent_self_discovery rows only); checkpoint_receipts (atomic
+       restart); stepwise_strategy_accrual_ready (exact downstream field); gate_check_summary
+       (failed check, expected value, and observed value); verifier_is_oracle (false, exact outcomes
+       are external authority); verdict_class (closed enum: positive | circular_positive | null |
+       blocked | disqualified | partial); honest_verdict (terminal and row-supported).
+
+    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6819_arc_stepwise_strategy_accrual.py --date {date}
+    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
